  /// <summary>
  /// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  /// TenantAuthPolicy — how the people of one tenant sign in. One row per tenant;
  /// a tenant without a row gets the defaults (passwords required, no
  /// passwordless channel, no magic link, no step-up rule).
